  "releaseNotes": "Replaced `sprintf`/`printf` usage across the parser, emitter, and path DSL with plain string concatenation. F#'s printf machinery builds format functions via reflection, which crashed under NativeAOT on any malformed YAML input (or on `ToString()`/`_Print`); the library is now verified to work in a NativeAOT-published app.\n`IsAotCompatible` set on the library project.",
